{"id":53165,"date":"2026-07-09T05:58:34","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T04:58:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/neon-juncal\/"},"modified":"2026-09-18T08:36:25","modified_gmt":"2026-09-18T07:36:25","slug":"neon-juncal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/neon-juncal\/","title":{"rendered":"Neon Juncal 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Neon Juncal 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Neon Juncal 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na noite de <strong>4 de Setembro de 2026<\/strong> (Sexta-feira), com in\u00edcio marcado para as <strong>21:00<\/strong> no <strong>Parque Verde do Juncal<\/strong>, na freguesia do Juncal, concelho de <strong>Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Inserido nas tradicionais Festas do Fregu\u00eas, o evento proporciona uma vibrante celebra\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva e recreativa iluminada por cores fluorescentes.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa contempla uma animada caminhada noturna na dist\u00e2ncia de <strong>5 km<\/strong>, aberta a participantes de todas as idades num tra\u00e7ado acess\u00edvel e seguro pelas ruas da vila. Com muita m\u00fasica, anima\u00e7\u00e3o e conv\u00edvio popular, a iniciativa combina lazer e atividade f\u00edsica, assegurando seguro desportivo, abastecimento, T-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial e stick neon a todos os inscritos.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Junta de Freguesia do Juncal<\/strong>, com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong> e a coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Recorde Pessoal<\/strong>, garantindo uma noite memor\u00e1vel de festa, cor e partilha comunit\u00e1ria.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: bre